Scoped whole-stream hash muxers and integer digests

The md5, hash, streamhash and crc trailer lines in src/hash/hash-mux.ts follow
libavformat/hashenc.c (hash_init, streamhash_init, hash_write_packet,
hash_write_trailer) and crcenc.c (crc_init, crc_write_packet,
crc_write_trailer). The digests in src/hash/digests.ts follow libavutil/md5.c,
sha.c, crc.c (AV_CRC_32_IEEE_LE), adler32.c and hash.c (names, seeds, final
byte order).
